      "id": "m01",
      "text": "The Parser must correctly match strings that end with a newline character without failing or producing unexpected results."
    },
    {
      "id": "m02",
      "text": "The Parser must correctly interpret and apply type conversions when using digit field numbering in the format specification."
    }
